# Build context exclusions.
#
# Without this file the build context includes .venv, .git and the caches —
# hundreds of megabytes uploaded to the daemon on every build, and a real chance
# of baking a developer's local virtualenv into the image.
.venv/
venv/
.git/
.gitignore
.github/

# Secrets: never ship a real .env into a layer. `.env.example` is committed on
# purpose — it documents the configuration contract.
.env
.env.local

__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/

# Runtime artifacts, regenerated by `adp-agent seed` inside the container.
data/logs/
data/estate.json
*.duckdb

tests/
evals/
docker/
README.md
